# Context Workspace (locked)

**Canonical:** `docs/adr/022-context-workspace-first.md`

## One sentence

> **Chat mutates the Workspace; Commit roots the Globe.**

Context Workspace = Cursor IDE. Globe = Context Forest (not the editor).

## Cursor ↔ Rimvio

```
Context AI → 2D Workspace → Auto Save Draft → Reality Commit → 3D Globe Forest
(≈ Chat → IDE → Auto Save → Git Commit → Repository)
```

## Core UX

```
대화 → 자연어로 작업 → 자동 저장(Draft) → Commit → Globe 반영
```

- AI는 장문 답변이 아니라 **Workspace Patch** (생성·삭제·연결·필터·시뮬·예약·비교)
- **Save 버튼 없음** — 항상 Draft Auto Save
- **Commit** 후에만 Globe / Ontology / Timeline / Memory / History
- WHY = Action · Reason · Impact — 노드/엣지 말풍선, on demand
- Current Context bar = 지금 작업 중인 프로젝트 (OS 현재 앱)

## Preview → Open Workspace

```
Assistant Preview (chat embed)
  → 펼치기 → full 2D Workspace
```

User copy: **펼치기**. Internal: `workspace_preview` → `workspace_expand`.

## Map-needed work

`호텔 · 맛집 · POI · 편의` → Workspace-first → Commit → Globe  
Scout stays; output = Patch only. No early 3D paint.

## Maps

- Workspace 2D default = **MapLibre** (sharp street zoom)
- Optional Apple MapKit via env — not required
- **No 3D↔2D hybrid on Globe** — Workspace is a separate surface only

## Always One New Concept

한 화면에 Workspace + WHY + Agent + Draft + Forest를 동시에 가르치지 않는다.

## PR reject

- Search results only in assistant text  
- Globe stamp before Commit  
- Manual Save as primary  
- Globe used as live editor  
- Agent / Simulation as first-paint product nouns
